# Private AI-assisted development workflow. These directories and files are
# kept locally for the maintainer's own use and deliberately never committed:
#   .opencode/                 local agent state and the project-local kit
#   scripts/                   personal export/packaging tooling (archives the
#                              project for AI review); contains no application
#                              code - if real project scripts are ever added,
#                              prefer a negation rule over removing this line
#   docs/                      internal audit reports, implementation plans,
#                              working notes, redesign evidence (screenshots,
#                              test logs) and third-party design references
#   prompts/                   AI prompt templates for the private workflow
#   AGENTS.md                  agent instructions for the private workflow
#   PLAN-TO-PRODUCTION.md      internal implementation plan
#   README-SETUP.md            internal workflow-kit setup notes
/.opencode/
/scripts/
/docs/
/prompts/
/AGENTS.md
/PLAN-TO-PRODUCTION.md
/README-SETUP.md

# Temporary local files
/commit-message.txt
